From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: darkyzhou <7220778+darkyzhou@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 1 Jan 2000 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: add loong64 (loongarch64) architecture support

Registers loong64 (LoongArch64) as a build target across the gulp REH, scan, and desktop pipelines, the CLI Platform enum (mapped from the loongarch64 target), and the extension TargetPlatform, so VSCodium can build and distribute the REH server and packages for LoongArch 64-bit machines (#2087).

